    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi></math> is the inverse of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;i.e.&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br />Differentiating both the sides w.r.t&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> , we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p></blockquote>"
